+# Reservation implementation plan
+
+## Requirements
+Preserve stock reads (R1); validate and reserve all lines atomically (R2).
+Equivalent retries must not deduct again (R3); cancellation restores once (R4).
+Immutable records, snapshots, and isolated services satisfy R5. Preserve runtime
+and test contracts and record verification for R6.
+
+## Approach
+Keep the frozen Reservation model. Normalize all lines in inventory/service.py
+before looking up history. Add two-pass deduction and restoration to
+inventory/store.py. Replace records on cancellation instead of mutating them.
+
+## Failure cases
+Reject malformed quantities and unknown SKUs before any stock changes. Check
+all availability before deduction. Failed IDs remain reusable; conflicting
+retries fail, and cancelled retries never reactivate the reservation.
+
+## Testing
+Run python -m pytest -q tests. Add visible coverage for reserve/retry/cancel and
+partial failure followed by successful ID reuse. Check edge cases independently
+with the private reference validation during benchmark development.
